The Lojban Mini-Lesson: composed originally, I believe, by Athelstan.

Can be found on the web in [http://www.lojban.org/files/brochures/minilesson.txt|text form] and in [http://www.lojban.org/files/brochures/minilsn.html|HTML] (the [http://www.lojban.org/files/brochures/miniexer.html|exercises] for the HTML version are on a separate page).

The text promises a "commented ((minilesson answer key|answer key))"; however, this does not yet exist. I had a go at providing one; see the link. Suggestions and corrections are welcome. --mi'e ((filip))
